  "full_text": "On my operating system, I have some quotes from God. And I also have other stuff all over the internet. And God told me one time, I have weeds in my wheat. Now the council of Nicene decided what went in the Bible. And they made it infallible. The question is, how do you make something infallible? It's kind of a funny question. God doesn't repeat. You can't just ask him again. So I'm trying to make a funny song. Weeds in my wheat. Weeds in my wheat. God doesn't repeat. I had some other, well, I had to break on it.",
